emecoins, decentralized apps, and consumer-facing products. SOL is used for transaction fees, staking, and participating in the Solana ecosystem. Traders often associate Solana with strong retail momentum and fast-moving onchain activity. Its market narrative is closely tied to adoption, network reliability, and the pace of new app launches.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Benchmarks' Solana-Dollar Real Time Index\",\"keywords\":[\"sol\",\"solana\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"SOL\",\"market_screen_title\":\"SOL\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#5598D8\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#66509ED5\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#7B8FFF\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#44B8CA\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#44B8CA\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#766DE9\",\"subaccount_id\":66,\"subcategory\":\"SOL\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":14211709.2194,\"recent_volume\":1504750,\"search_score\":21000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXSOLPERP\",\"series_title\":\"SOL\",\"tags\":[\"SOL\"],\"ticker\":\"KXSOLPERP\",\"title\":\"SOL\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"sol\",\"solana\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":1530642365.8177,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":162979184,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":1,\"derived_decimal_count\":4,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXNEARPERP\",\"event_title\":\"NEAR\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-02T11:18:21.275812Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":4.1018,\"leverage_estimate\":2.0427,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":2.0394,\"10000\":2.027,\"100000\":1.9684,\"1000000\":1.7072},\"market_id\":\"05306a