lt around a research-driven approach to network design. ADA is its native asset and is used for transaction fees, staking, and governance. Traders often follow it as a large-cap Layer 1 asset tied to smart-contract adoption and ecosystem growth. Network upgrades, developer activity, and broader demand for alternative blockchains can influence its price.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CME CF Cardano-Dollar Real Time Index\",\"keywords\":[\"ada\",\"cardano\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"ADA\",\"market_screen_title\":\"ADA\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#4879FF\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#660A0C0F\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#4879FF\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#0A0C0F\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#0C0F13\",\"subaccount_id\":106,\"subcategory\":\"ADA\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":1738208.2594,\"recent_volume\":9057685,\"search_score\":18000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXADAPERP\",\"series_title\":\"ADA\",\"tags\":[\"ADA\"],\"ticker\":\"KXADAPERP\",\"title\":\"ADA\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"ada\",\"cardano\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":121785062.2678,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":545331700,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Indices\",\"category\":\"Indices\",\"contract_size\":0.001,\"derived_decimal_count\":1,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXUS500PERP\",\"event_title\":\"US Large Cap\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-02T11:18:21.275812Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":13.4286,\"leverage_estimate\":12.2355,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":12.2355,\"10000\":12.2355,\"100000\":12.2355,\"1000000\":12.2355},\"market_id\":\"01a0fdae-d5b7-7985-8692-e07ae79d623f\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":13.3584,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"US Large Cap\",\"categories\":[\"Indices\"],\"category\":\"Indices\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#803C50FF\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#803C50FF\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#003C50FF\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#003C50FF\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#3C50FF\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#3C50FF\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-10-16/KXUS500PERP.png\",\"decimal_count\":2,\"description\":\"Kalshi offers broad exposure to US large cap companies through Kalshi's US Large Cap index perpetual future. The underlying index is calculated by MerQube (https://merqube.com/indices/MQ5CT), which has historically shown 99%+ daily-return correlation with major U.S. large-cap benchmarks, including the S\\u0026P 500\u00ae.\\n\\nThe index is made up of 500 large publicly traded US companies and is weighted by market capitalization, so bigger companies like Nvidia, Microsoft and Apple move the price much more than smaller ones. It's a total return index, which means dividends are reinvested back into the index.\\n\\nWhat to watch: Company earnings, Federal Reserve interest-rate decisions, monthly jobs and inflation reports, and overall investor sentiment.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 16 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"MerQube US Large Cap TR Index\",\"keywords\":[\"us 500\",\"us500\",\"us large cap\",\"large cap\",\"mq5ct\",\"merqube\",\"equities\",\"stocks\",\"index\",\"indices\",\"s\\u0026p\",\"s\\u0026p 500\",\"sp500\",\"spx\",\"spy\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"MERQUBE:MQ5CT\",\"market_screen_title\":\"US Large Cap\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#3C50FF\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#660E133D\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#3C50FF\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#0E133D\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#0E133D\",\"shareable_layer2_grad