rk built around World ID, a privacy-preserving proof-of-human system. WLD is the network's token and is closely tied to adoption of the World app and identity infrastructure. Traders often follow it as a bet on digital identity in a world shaped by artificial intelligence. User growth, verification rollouts, token supply, and regulatory developments can influence its price.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Worldcoin-Dollar Spot Rate\",\"keywords\":[\"wld\",\"worldcoin\",\"world id\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"WLD\",\"market_screen_title\":\"WLD\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#949494\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#660A0C0F\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#949494\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#0A0C0F\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#0C0F13\",\"subaccount_id\":104,\"subcategory\":\"WLD\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":1249726.3754,\"recent_volume\":3219366,\"search_score\":16000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXWLDPERP\",\"series_title\":\"WLD\",\"tags\":[\"WLD\"],\"ticker\":\"KXWLDPERP\",\"title\":\"WLD\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"wld\",\"worldcoin\",\"world id\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":153796743.1413,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":320962224,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":1,\"derived_decimal_count\":4,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXUNIPERP\",\"event_title\":\"UNI\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0.0004107478355457,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-02T11:18:21.275812Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":7.1532,\"leverage_estimate\":2.8289,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":2.8206,\"10000\":2.7919,\"100000\":2.656,\"1000000\":2.1166},\"market_id\":\"01a0e8d5-18ed-7ecc-9cd0-9e69e91a4dc9\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":7.2328,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"Uniswap\",\"categories\":[\"Crypto\"],\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#80C645C0\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#80C645C0\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00C645C0\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#00C645C0\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#C645C0\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#C645C0\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-25/KXUNIPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":2,\"description\":\"Uniswap is a popular app for trading crypto directly with other people, no bank or exchange needed. UNI is its token. For a long time, owning UNI mainly just gave you a vote in how Uniswap is run.\\n\\nKey factors in play: Uniswap now takes a small cut of trading fees and uses it to permanently remove some UNI from circulation. This means the more people use Uniswap, the more it can affect UNI's supply. Changes in how governments regulate trading platforms like this can also affect how much people use Uniswap, and in turn, UNI's price.\\n\\nWhat to watch: How much people are trading on Uniswap, votes on fee changes, and overall activity in the crypto market.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Benchmarks' Uniswap-Dollar Real Time Index\",\"keywords\":[\"uni\",\"uniswap\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"UNI\",\"market_screen_title\":\"UNI\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#C645C0\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#66541E52\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#C645C0\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#672260\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#541E52\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#C645C0\",\"subcategory\":\"UNI\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":841228.7721,\"recent_volume\":115980,\"search_score\":15000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXUNIPERP\",\"series_titl