ases. It is commonly associated with payment use cases, tipping culture, and speculative momentum. Its price action is frequently driven as much by sentiment as by fundamentals.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Benchmarks' Dogecoin-Dollar Spot Rate\",\"keywords\":[\"doge\",\"dogecoin\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"DOGE\",\"market_screen_title\":\"DOGE\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#E1C16D\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#663D3014\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#C2A733\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#3D3014\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#3D3014\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#C2A733\",\"subaccount_id\":68,\"subcategory\":\"DOGE\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":412223.4991,\"recent_volume\":54525,\"search_score\":11000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXDOGEPERP\",\"series_title\":\"DOGE\",\"tags\":[\"DOGE\"],\"ticker\":\"KXDOGEPERP\",\"title\":\"DOGE\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"doge\",\"dogecoin\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":325816553.3807,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":41233306,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":0.01,\"derived_decimal_count\":2,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXAAVEPERP\",\"event_title\":\"AAVE\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-02T11:18:21.275812Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":1.3147,\"leverage_estimate\":3.3717,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":3.3585,\"10000\":3.3094,\"100000\":3.0875,\"1000000\":2.2762},\"market_id\":\"01a045f4-92f6-79d4-8348-ba28f8d76d3b\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":1.3631,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"Aave\",\"categories\":[\"Crypto\"],\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#409391FE\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#409391FE\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00000000\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#00000000\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#9391FE\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#9391FE\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-24/KXAAVEPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":2,\"description\":\"Aave is a decentralized finance protocol for lending and borrowing crypto assets. The AAVE token is used in protocol governance and helps align participants around risk and upgrades. Traders often follow it as a benchmark for activity in onchain credit markets. Its price can react to changes in deposits, borrowing demand, protocol revenue, governance decisions, and broader DeFi sentiment.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CME CF Aave-Dollar Real Time Index\",\"keywords\":[\"aave\",\"crypto\",\"defi\",\"lending\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"AAVE\",\"market_screen_title\":\"AAVE\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#9391FE\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#660A0C0F\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#9391FE\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#0A0C0F\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#0C0F13\",\"subaccount_id\":103,\"subcategory\":\"AAVE\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":431150.2197,\"recent_volume\":318539,\"search_score\":10000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXAAVEPERP\",\"series_title\":\"AAVE\",\"tags\":[\"AAVE\"],\"ticker\":\"KXAAVEPERP\",\"title\":\"AAVE\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"aave\",\"crypto\",\"defi\",\"lending\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":34143210.43,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":23620562,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":0.01,\"derived_decimal_count\":2,\"event_subtitle\":\"