quently think of it as a legacy crypto asset that still benefits when market attention returns to older large-cap coins. It often moves with broader crypto trends rather than a unique application narrative.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Benchmarks' Litecoin-Dollar Real Time Index\",\"keywords\":[\"ltc\",\"litecoin\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"LTC\",\"market_screen_title\":\"LTC\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#345E9D\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#66325F9D\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#4575BF\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#1A3761\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#1A3761\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#345E9D\",\"subaccount_id\":71,\"subcategory\":\"LTC\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":357495.8458,\"recent_volume\":64507,\"search_score\":8000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXLTCPERP\",\"series_title\":\"LTC\",\"tags\":[\"LTC\"],\"ticker\":\"KXLTCPERP\",\"title\":\"LTC\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"ltc\",\"litecoin\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":267220814.1656,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":54539197,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Metals\",\"category\":\"Metals\",\"contract_size\":1,\"derived_decimal_count\":4,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXCOPPERPERP\",\"event_title\":\"Copper\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":-0.0002737442661005,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-02T11:18:21.275812Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":6.6306,\"leverage_estimate\":7.8507,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":7.8507,\"10000\":7.8507,\"100000\":7.8507,\"1000000\":7.8188},\"market_id\":\"01a0fd94-454e-77b7-91db-e0e4e4f15369\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":6.589,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"Copper\",\"categories\":[\"Metals\"],\"category\":\"Metals\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#40AF654B\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#40AF654B\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00AF654B\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#00AF654B\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#AF654B\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#AF654B\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-24/KXCOPPERPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":3,\"description\":\"Copper is a reddish metal used to carry electricity and heat, found in wiring, pipes, electronics, and EVs. Its price tracks global building and manufacturing activity. In recent years, global copper usage has outpaced new mine supply, partly because new mines take a long time to develop, though recycling and new production projects are also part of the supply picture. Demand has grown from EVs, power grids, and the wiring needed for AI data centers, while trade policies and tariffs can affect how easily copper moves around the world.\\n\\nWhat to watch: Global manufacturing and construction data, AI and data center buildout news, and trade policy between major economies.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 10 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"Pyth Copper Reference Rate\",\"keywords\":[\"copper\",\"metals\",\"industrial metals\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"PYTH:CU\",\"market_screen_title\":\"Copper\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#AF654B\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#662A1812\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#AF654B\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#2A1812\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#2A1812\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#AF654B\",\"subaccount_id\":100,\"subcategory\":\"Copper\",\"trading_hours\":\"Sun 6pm \u2013 Fri 5pm ET\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":241373.5867,\"recent_volume\":36501,\"search_score\":7000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXCOPPERPERP\",\"series_title\":\"Copper\",\"tags\":[\"Copper\"],\"ticker\":\"KXCOPPERPERP\",\"title\":\"Copper\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"copper\",\"metals\",\"industrial metals\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":13497740.1486,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":2020318,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Metals\",\"category\":\"Metals\",\"contract_size\":0.001,\"derived_decimal_count\":1,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXPLATINUMPERP\",\"event_title\":\"Platinum\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0.0002025956396735,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-02T11:18:21.275812Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":1.4363,\"leverage_estimate\":6.6094,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":6.6094,\"10000\":6.6094,\"100000\":6.5811,\"1000000\":6.3898},\"market_id\":\"01a0c632-d5b5-73be-b6a2-0cc504110b59\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":1.4362,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"Platinum\",\"categories\":[\"Metals\"],\"category\":\"Metals\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#40AEB1C9\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#40AEB1C9\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00AEB1C9\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#00AEB1C9\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-24/KXPLATINUMPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":2,\"description\":\"Platinum is a precious metal used in diesel catalytic converters (which reduce vehicle emissions), fuel cells, and jewelry.\\n\\nKey factors in play: Platinum's price mostly comes down to a tug of war between constrained supply and shifting demand. Mining disruptions in South Africa, the largest producer, have kept output tight, according to the World Platinum Investment Council (WPIC). Jewelry buying and hybrid vehicle catalyst use have been demand drivers, while rising EV adoption works in the other direction, since EVs need no catalytic converter at all.\\n\\nWhat to watch: Gold price moves, Federal Reserve meetings, CPI releases, and South African mine supply news.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 10 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"Pyth Platinum Reference Rate\",\"keywords\":[\"platinum\",\"xpt\",\"metals\",\"precious metals\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"PYTH:XPTUSD\",\"market_screen_title\":\"Platinum\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#66292A30\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#292A30\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#292A30\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"subaccount_id\":91,\"subcategory\":\"Platinum\",\"trading_hours\":\"Sun 6pm \u2013 Fri 5pm ET\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":661706.7482,\"recent_volume\":460198,\"search_score\":6000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXPLATINUMPERP\",\"series_title\":\"Platinum\",\"tags\":[\"Platinum\"],\"ticker\":\"KXPLATINUMPERP\",\"title\":\"Platinum\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"platinum\",\"xpt\",\"metals\",\"precious metals\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":50159127.4582,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":30387788,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Metals\",\"category\":\"Metals\",\"contract_size\":0.001,\"derived_decimal_count\":1,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXPALLADIUMPERP\",\"event_title\":\"Palladium\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0.0003347796728974,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-02T11:18:21.275812Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":0.9813,\"leverage_estimate\":4.583,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":4.5803,\"10000\":4.5694,\"100000\":4.5264,\"1000000\":4.318},\"market_id\":\"01a0c633-07bf-7ed9-9a5c-bec9f3d48d43\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":0.9801,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"Palladium\",\"categories\":[\"Metals\"],\"category\":\"Metals\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#40C1BFAC\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#40C1BFAC\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00C1BFAC\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#00C1BFAC\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#C1BFAC\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#C1BFAC\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-24/KXPALLADIUMPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":2,\"description\":\"Palladium is a precious metal used almost entirely for one purpose: catalytic converters in gasoline vehicles.\\n\\nKey factors in play: Palladium's price has declined as its main use case shrinks. Automakers have been shifting to EVs, which don't need catalytic converters, and substituting cheaper platinum where they can. That's pushed demand down over time, and some forecasters, including the WPIC and Heraeus, expect a market surplus. On the supply side, a large share of palladium comes from Russia and South Africa, so sanctions or mining disruptions in either country can affect the price.\\n\\nWhat to watch: Tariff and sanctions news, auto sales data, and Federal Reserve meetings.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 10 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"Pyth Palladium Reference Rate\",\"keywords\":[\"palladium\",\"xpd\",\"metals\",\"precious metals\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"PYTH:XPDUSD\",\"market_screen_title\":\"Palladium\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#C1BFAC\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#662E2D29\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#C1BFAC\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#2E2D29\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#2E2D29\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#C1BFAC\",\"subaccount_id\":90,\"subcategory\":\"Palladium\",\"trading_hours\":\"Sun 6pm \u2013 Fri 5pm ET\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":411319.8138,\"recent_volume\":416678,\"search_