emerging onchain apps, gaming, and payment-style use cases. Adoption trends, network growth, and ecosystem launches can all influence sentiment around SUI.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Benchmarks' Sui-Dollar Real Time Index\",\"keywords\":[\"sui\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"SUI\",\"market_screen_title\":\"SUI\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#4CA4FF\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#664CA4FF\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#66B2FF\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#0E1D2D\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#0E1D2D\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#4CA4FF\",\"subaccount_id\":73,\"subcategory\":\"SUI\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":209764.889,\"recent_volume\":23377,\"search_score\":4000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXSUIPERP\",\"series_title\":\"SUI\",\"tags\":[\"SUI\"],\"ticker\":\"KXSUIPERP\",\"title\":\"SUI\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"sui\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":491531146.3081,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":64267719,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":0.1,\"derived_decimal_count\":3,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXVVVPERP\",\"event_title\":\"VVV\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":-0.0001480705124707,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-02T11:18:21.275812Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":2.2146,\"leverage_estimate\":1.7774,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":1.7616,\"10000\":1.7008,\"100000\":1.4381,\"1000000\":0.7283},\"market_id\":\"01a045f5-aa5b-74fa-83f1-f5af6307208b\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":2.3328,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"VVV\",\"categories\":[\"Crypto\"],\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#40D45028\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#40D45028\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00000000\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#00000000\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#D45028\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#D45028\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-24/KXVVVPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":3,\"description\":\"Venice Token is the utility token for Venice.ai, a privacy-focused generative AI platform. VVV is designed to give agents and developers access to private, on-demand AI inference through Venice's API. Traders often follow it at the intersection of crypto and artificial-intelligence infrastructure. Platform usage, token utility, AI demand, and broader sentiment around crypto AI projects can influence its price.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Venice Token-Dollar Spot Rate\",\"keywords\":[\"vvv\",\"venice token\",\"venice ai\",\"crypto\",\"ai\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"VVV\",\"market_screen_title\":\"VVV\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#D45028\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#660A0C0F\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#D45028\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#0A0C0F\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#0C0F13\",\"subaccount_id\":105,\"subcategory\":\"VVV\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":277265.6289,\"recent_volume\":121955,\"search_score\":3000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXVVVPERP\",\"series_title\":\"VVV\",\"tags\":[\"VVV\"],\"ticker\":\"KXVVVPERP\",\"title\":\"VVV\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"vvv\",\"venice token\",\"venice ai\",\"crypto\",\"ai\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":153452572.4862,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":60192177,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":1000,\"derived_decimal_count\":7,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXKSHIBPERP\",\"event_title\":\"kSHIB\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-02T11:18:21.275812Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":4.62,\"leverage_estimate\":2.2693,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":2.2559,\"10000\":2.2023,\"100000\":1.9669,\"1000000\":1.2269},\"market_id\":\"e8bd7a88-db45-40d8-a2cb-2ea90ad2f003\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":4.6792,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"Shiba Inu\",\"categories\":[\"Crypto\"],\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#80FAB500\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#80FAB500\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00FEEDC1\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#00FEEDC1\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#E9C36C\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#E9C36C\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-24/KXKSHIBPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":6,\"description\":\"Shiba Inu is a memecoin that grew from an internet-driven community project into one of the most recognized retail crypto assets. It is closely associated with meme culture, social media attention, and speculative trading activity. SHIB's market behavior is often driven by sentiment, community engagement, and broader appetite for high-beta crypto trades. Traders also watch developments around the Shiba Inu ecosystem, including tokens, apps, and network initiatives tied to the brand. It is generally treated as a retail-driven momentum asset rather than a fundamentals-led large-cap coin.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Benchmarks' Shiba Inu-Dollar Spot Rate\",\"keywords\":[\"shib\",\"shiba inu\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"market_screen_title\":\"kSHIB\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#FFAA09\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#66FFAA09\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#FFAA09\",\"shareable_layer